# The Gobbiebag Part IV (jeuno 30): Lower Jeuno's Bluffnix (no script; default 43 with 81), the template GobbiebagQuest.
# A level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 1, the inventory at 45 (storage; a fresh char has 30), Parts I-III completed
# (the chain's earlier parts, by a GM), the four items, a Bowl of Goblin Stew (880) and a Chocobo Feather. Available: a
# trade: no trade handler; 43 (46, 0, 1), option 1: nothing; option 0: begun. Accepted: 43 (46, 1, 1), its finish: no
# handler; three items, the four and the feather, the stew and an item: 43 (46, 1, 1); the stew alone: 73 (51), the
# quest completed by a GM while it is open: no 73 finish (the stew kept); accepted again (a GM): the four items: 73
# (51), finished: completed, the inventory 50, INVENTORY_INCREASED, the items taken (no satchel: unchanged). Completed:
# no section; Bluffnix's default 43 (81) (Part V wants fame level 3). Set accepted by a GM at 50: the accepted check
# fails: no section (43 (81)), a trade: nothing; set available by a GM at 50: no section. A GM sets a part available
# before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/73
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
storage inventory 45                    # the part's start size (char_storage.inventory; a fresh char has 30)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIi completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIii completed
item CermetChunk
item DarksteelIngot
item SquareOfSilkCloth
item Goshenite
item BowlOfGoblinStew880
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Bluffnix ChocoboFeather x1        # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # reqsMet: 43 (46, 0, 1)
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # 43 (46, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted: 43 (46, 1, 1)
finish option=0                         # no 43 finish while accepted: nothing
trade Bluffnix CermetChunk x1 DarksteelIngot x1 SquareOfSilkCloth x1 # three of the four: 43 (46, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix CermetChunk x1 DarksteelIngot x1 SquareOfSilkCloth x1 Goshenite x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: 43 (46, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1 CermetChunk x1 # the stew and an item: 43 (46, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1   # the stew alone: 73 (51)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv completed # a GM, while 73 is open
finish                                  # no 73 finish while completed: nothing (the stew kept)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv accepted # a GM
trade Bluffnix CermetChunk x1 DarksteelIngot x1 SquareOfSilkCloth x1 Goshenite x1 # the four items: 73 (51)
finish                                  # completed; inventory 50; INVENTORY_INCREASED; the items taken
trigger Bluffnix                        # completed: no section; 43 (81)
finish option=1                         # declined: nothing
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv accepted # a GM, at 50
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the inventory 50: no section; 43 (81)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1   # no section: nothing
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartIv available # a GM, at 50
trigger Bluffnix                        # available, the inventory 50: no section; 43 (81)
finish option=0                         # no section: not begun
